[[2047,96,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The heated rear windscreen relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nlocated in the junction unit\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , controls the simultaneous\nengagement of the demisting of both the rear windscreen \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\nthe external rear view mirrors  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P61</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply circuit of the heated rear window \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55 passes through a special interference filter in versions\nwith predisposition for a radio.</strong></p><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied by the direct\nline from the battery through the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - always for \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\nand the maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong></p><p>The supply for the coil for relay\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is\ncontrolled by the ignition. (INT/A) of line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nsupplementary fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>An earth signal coming from the integrated\nservices control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 9 of connector B) energizes\nthe coil of the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , with the supply consequently sent\nto resistors \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P61</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is supplied by an\nignition-operated supply (INT) from fuse line \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of supplementary\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>When an earth command is received (pin 14\nof connector B) coming from the climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (heated\nrear windscreen on button pressed), according to the control logic\ndescribed previously, a command is sent which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               coil.\n(pin 9 of connector B). Similarly, when the &#x27;rapid demisting&#x27; function\nis activated, the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends a signal to pin\n17 of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>At the same time as the activation of the\nresistances, a signal is sent (from pin 11, of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )\nto light up the LED in the control button which is located in the\nclimate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]